                                "sense_id": "b2719ddc-a8fe-3b00-902e-a9fe50d41f8e",
                                "text": "It weren't like I wanted to go to the meeting, I could think of plenty of stuff I'd rather than spending all evening sat in a room with the same bunch of dribblers I'd spent all fucking day with."
